WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:48.992
Ella's father was on a hunting trip.

2
00:00:48.993 --> 00:00:52.160
One morning Stepmother woke Ella.

3
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:55.384
"Get up, lazy girl," she snapped.

4
00:00:55.384 --> 00:01:00.037
"I have some news. Your father is dead!"

5
00:01:00.037 --> 00:01:04.623
Ella gasped. Tears filled her eyes.

6
00:01:04.623 --> 00:01:07.876
"Oh no!" she cried in pain.

7
00:01:07.876 --> 00:01:16.522
"Father! My poor father . . ."

8
00:01:16.522 --> 00:01:24.814
After that, nothing was the same.

9
00:01:24.814 --> 00:01:27.325
Ella was still kind and polite.

10
00:01:27.325 --> 00:01:32.758
But Stepmother was now mean.

11
00:01:32.758 --> 00:01:37.162
Stepmother gave fancy dresses to her daughters.

12
00:01:37.162 --> 00:01:41.130
Ella wore ugly, old rags.

13
00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:44.752
The stepsisters slept in soft feather beds.

14
00:01:44.752 --> 00:01:50.521
Ella slept on a hard bed made of straw.

15
00:01:50.521 --> 00:01:53.714
Gert napped all day long.

16
00:01:53.714 --> 00:01:57.567
Trudy ate all day long.

17
00:01:57.567 --> 00:02:01.369
But Stepmother made Ella work.

18
00:02:01.369 --> 00:02:09.099
She scrubbed, swept, and mopped.

19
00:02:09.099 --> 00:02:12.376
"Pretty little Ella," Stepmother said.

20
00:02:12.377 --> 00:02:14.719
"You think you're better than we are.

21
00:02:14.719 --> 00:02:17.895
You think you're prettier too."

22
00:02:17.895 --> 00:02:20.097
"No, I don't!" Ella said.

23
00:02:20.098 --> 00:02:21.646
"You're my family now.

24
00:02:21.646 --> 00:02:24.210
I love all of you."

25
00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.311
"Ugh." Stepmother sneered. "You're too nice.

26
00:02:28.311 --> 00:02:29.896
Go and make my lunch!

27
00:02:29.896 --> 00:02:32.131
And tend the fire again!

28
00:02:32.131 --> 00:02:37.301
I don't want my daughters to catch a cold."

29
00:02:37.301 --> 00:02:41.395
Ella liked to sit near the fire.

30
00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:44.269
She remembered her days with Father.

31
00:02:44.269 --> 00:02:52.033
"I miss him so much," she thought.

32
00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:57.719
The stepsisters saw Ella by the fire.

33
00:02:57.719 --> 00:03:02.783
Trudy giggled. "You're covered in ashes!"

34
00:03:02.783 --> 00:03:07.351
"Ella likes ashes and cinders," Gert said.

35
00:03:07.351 --> 00:03:15.884
"Let's call her . . . Cinderella!"
